    <div style="margin-top:-10px; padding:10px 15px;background-color:#FFFFFF; border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;text-align:justify;">
            2. MATTERS COVERED :
            This Agreement covers litigation pertaining to Client’s relationship with Client’s mortgage lender, servicer and/or related parties pertaining to Client’s property located at 
        <strong>Sonaj, Nashik, Maharashtra, 423208 </strong> the alleged wrongful foreclosure of this property, personal injuries associated with lender’s conduct, and the issues related to payment of the mortgage loan. This agreement does not cover any bankruptcy services.
        </p>
    </div>
    
     <div style="margin-top:-10px; padding:10px 15px; background-color:#FFFFFF; border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;text-align:justify;">
            3. SERVICES TO BE PERFORMED BY ATTORNEY:  
            Attorney agrees to perform all litigation services necessary to preserve Client’s rights, 
            including but not limited to the following: reviewing Client’s files and determining the feasibility of a 
            lawsuit or other legal action against adverse parties, and, if feasible, filing and prosecuting a lawsuit.  Where advisable the Firm will prosecute appeals under this agreement. The Firm, however, reserves the right not to prosecute any appeal as it may affect the rights of all clients.  This agreement covers one litigation pertaining to the property above on behalf of client. If client wishes other lawsuits to be filed an additional agreement and fee would need to be negotiated.  To keep costs down the firm may use contract attorneys and the firm may employ contract attorneys from time to time to assist with Client’s case.  Client consents to the use of contract attorneys.   Attorney will endeavor to respond to all emails received during business hours by no later than the next business day.  If the Client would prefer a phone call rather than an email communication, Client agrees to email Attorney to schedule a time to speak in order to maximize efficiency.  
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-top:-10px; padding:10px 15px; background-color:#FFFFFF; border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;">
