           Client acknowledges and agrees that Attorney’s billable rate is $600 an hour for Sarah Shapero, $495 an hour for senior associates, $295-$325 an hour for junior associates, and $150 an hour for investigators and paralegals.  
           However, in lieu of paying Attorney’s hourly rate, 
           Client agrees to pay, on a flat fee basis, on a flat fee basis<!-- estimated value --> 12344 (matter) on the effective date of this Agreement.
           Thereafter, Client is to pay <!--Monthly Fee--> 12234 per month (plus costs as detailed below) Thereafter, Client is to pay Monthly Fee per month (plus costs as detailed below) on the 
            <strong>
                <apex:outputText value="{0,date,d}"><!--<apex:param value="{!StartDate}"/>--></apex:outputText> 
