            7. ATTORNEY’S LIEN:   
        Client agrees to grant Attorney a lien on any and all claims, causes of action, or attorney fees due pursuant to 
        this Agreement.  The lien, to ensure payment of any sums owing to attorney at the conclusion of services performed, 
        will attach to any recovery Client may obtain, or upon Client’s real or personal property.  
        Attorney may compel payment of fees and costs from any such funds recovered on behalf of Client, 
        even if Attorney has been discharged before the end of the case.  Client may seek the opinion of an independent 
        lawyer prior to agreeing to this lien. 
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-top:-10px; padding:10px 15px; background-color:#FFFFFF; border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;">
